{"chunk_id": "6d41280ad472", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "华为海思介绍", "date_hint": "", "text": "华为海思，全称海思半导体有限公司（HiSilicon），是华为的全资子公司，专注于半导体和集成电路的研发设计。海思成立于2004年，其前身是华为1991年成立的ASIC设计中心 。海思致力于提供智能家庭、智慧城市及智能出行等泛智能终端芯片解决方案 。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "6d41280ad472", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
